  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health: Toward Ending Female Genital Mutilation/Cutting in Africa and Beyond</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme combines targeted action with communities in 17 countries with support for legislative and policy change and effective implementation of laws and policies. It includes a robust international research component to build the global evidence base on the most effective strategies to end FGM/C. It will work with others to support a movement within countries and globally to raise awareness and understanding of FGM/C and build support for efforts to end the practice. This programme aims to work towards ending the practice in one generation.</narrative>
  </description>
